#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Island, one whole activity: Nick Brick's pizza, from the Pizzeria to
# Nubby at the gas station on the skateboard, then back to the Information
# Center and out by the quit door, which saves the game (#137).
#
# Recorded, not written: a synthetic hand in lego_island.rs (`delivery`) did
# this through the host, as a person's hand reaches a run in a window, and the
# run wrote down what it was handed. The pointer glides a few pixels a flip; a
# button is held two flips; a key as long as it is held, Up held down while
# Left turns the skateboard.
#
# Clicks on the floor skip the intro and the Infomaniac's welcome. In the
# Information Center the book is signed LEGO and Nick's portrait, the fourth,
# is picked; the elevator, the revolving door, and out at flip 7900. A step, a
# turn of 40 degrees to the bicycle, and down the road on it to the foot of the
# plaza. Turned to the town, the Pizzeria shows just over the handlebars, and
# is clicked at flip 10137: the game cuts to it, and Papa Brickolini brings a
# pizza out. Clicking it while he holds it out, at flip 11887, takes the job,
# and from flip 12447 Nick is on the skateboard beside the Pizzeria with the
# pizza on its dashboard. Up from flip 12538 with Left for the turns: east
# along the road, north at the crossroads, into the gas station's road, where
# at flip 13085 Nubby comes and takes the pizza, red. The Information Center's
# tower, clicked from the gas station at flip 14307, goes back inside; the quit
# door and yes save the game and the scores at flip 15327, the credits roll,
# and the game closes itself and leaves at flip 22041.
